      <abstract id="dcm-ov.Summary">
        <title>Summary</title>
        <p>The purpose of this overview is to:</p>
        <p><list list-type="order"><list-item><label>1</label><p><xref ref-type="sec" rid="dcm-ov.Dilated_Cardiomyopathy_DCM_Defini">Define</xref> DCM;</p></list-item><list-item><label>2</label><p>Identify the <xref ref-type="sec" rid="dcm-ov.Dilated_Cardiomyopathy_DCM_Catego">categories</xref> of DCM;</p></list-item><list-item><label>3</label><p>Provide the <xref ref-type="sec" rid="dcm-ov.Establishing_When_Possible_the_Sp">evaluation strategy</xref> of a proband with nonsyndromic DCM;</p></list-item><list-item><label>4</label><p>Provide a basic view of <xref ref-type="sec" rid="dcm-ov.Genetic_Risk_Assessment_and_Cardi">genetic risk assessment</xref> of at-risk asymptomatic relatives of a proband with DCM to inform <xref ref-type="sec" rid="dcm-ov.Cardiac_Surveillance">cardiac surveillance</xref> and allow early detection and treatment of DCM to improve long-term outcome.</p></list-item></list>
</p>
      </abstract>
